      "title": "Security & Safeguards",
      "items": [
        "Strict token authentication required for all diagnostic and management endpoints",
        "Module names sanitized via alphanumeric/hyphen regex to prevent shell injection",
        "Read-only assistant: AI diagnoses evidence but cannot autonomously alter kernel state"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "RAG Augmentation Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "Dynamic query synthesis combines target module, errors, and kernel version",
        "Dense embeddings generated locally using all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (384 dimensions)",
        "Curated Linux manual pages & kernel documentation prevent LLM hallucination"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Fault Tolerance & Fallback",
      "items": [
        "Per-command 3-second exec timeout prevents blocking on unresponsive kernel locks",
        "Graceful degradation returns raw system evidence if AI microservice is unconfigured",
        "Strict Pydantic schema validation guards against malformed LLM responses"
